  },
  {
   "copper": 600,
   "description": "The Crown Frost Strays on The Wyrmglass Crown have outlasted every record I can find of them. Get a boat from the Shipwright and sail across the channel to the island, then destroy eight at night in the Wyrmglass Scree, which lies in the north of The Wyrmglass Crown. Return for your payment in coin; the bounty becomes available again one hour after turn-in. Do return in person, please, rather than as another entry.",
